# Never bundle env files — Vercel uses Project Environment Variables.
# Local .env / .env.local symlinks point at ~/Desktop/QuikIT-Secrets which
# don't exist in Vercel's build container; bundling them causes stat ENOENT.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# Local-only dev artifacts
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/node_modules
**/coverage

# Tasks scratchpad
tasks/
